        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Javier Mora, Alexander Povetkin\n- Places: Max Schmeling Halle, Prenzlauer Berg, Berlin, Germany\n- Roles: professional boxer\n- Titles: WBA (Regular) heavyweight title\n\nFacts:\n- Alexander Povetkin was born on 2 September 1979.\n- Alexander Povetkin is a Russian professional boxer.\n- Alexander Povetkin held the WBA (Regular) heavyweight title from 2011 to 2013.\n- Javier Mora was defeated by Alexander Povetkin by a fifth-round technical knockout at Max Schmeling Halle in Prenzlauer Berg, Berlin, Germany.",
